@startuml
title Hierarchical workflow model and executable boundary
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #ECF5FC
  BorderColor #477B9B
  StartColor #2F7C5A
  EndColor #7D478F
  ArrowColor #496174
}

[*] --> Root
state Root #E9F5EA {
  [*] --> Intake
  Intake --> ParallelReview : completed
  state ParallelReview #FFF0D9 {
    state "Research region" as Research #DCEEFF
    [*] --> Research
    --
    state "Safety region" as Safety #E7DCF5
    [*] --> Safety
  }
  ParallelReview --> Approval : all join
  state Approval #FFE0C8
  Approval --> Publish : approved
  Approval --> Intake : rejected / bounded retry
  state Publish #D9EFDF
  Publish --> [*]
}
Root --> [*]

note right of ParallelReview #EAF7EE
Implemented now: flat canvas projection, parallel
tokens, typed joins, guarded routes, bounded cycles,
scope entry/exit activities, completion propagation,
shallow/deep history, durable resume, timer recovery,
compensation, and encrypted snapshots.
end note
note right of Approval #FFF3C9
Reserved next: MeTTaIL Foreign Language Terms,
run observability dashboards, a dedicated
hierarchy-canvas editor, and the durable-yield
resume command (see the roadmap's known gaps).
end note
@enduml
